## Hints for Future Agents
Keep expected condition JSON independent from BuildPolicyDocument or the same regression can be masked again. The declared condition schema is Map(Map(String)); Condition uses map[string]map[string][]string internally, so schema values must be decoded as strings before normalization. BuildPolicyDocument still ignores ElementsAs diagnostics for unknown or nested-null values. A fail-closed follow-up would need to propagate diagnostics through BuildPolicyDocument and DataSource.Read rather than silently omitting fields.

## Codebase Discoveries
BucketPolicyDocumentDataSource.Read is the only production caller of BuildPolicyDocument. The raw bucket-policy resource accepts a JSON string and passes it directly to PutBucketPolicy, which is why consumer code could work around the bug with jsonencode. Nearby side-effect-free object-storage unit tests call t.Parallel; protocol tests that set environment variables do not. Repository CODEOWNERS assigns all files to @coreweave/cloud-platform-api-team.

